Release 63 / Serial number 860811

Inside the Barrow
You are inside an ancient barrow hidden deep within a dark forest. The barrow
opens into a narrow tunnel at its southern end. You can see a faint glow at the
far end.
A sword of Elvish workmanship is on the ground.
A strangely familiar brass lantern is lying on the ground.

>look
Inside the Barrow
You are inside an ancient barrow hidden deep within a dark forest. The barrow
opens into a narrow tunnel at its southern end. You can see a faint glow at the
far end.
A sword of Elvish workmanship is on the ground.
A strangely familiar brass lantern is lying on the ground.

>inventory
